2|//!
3|//! ## Components
4|//!
5|//! - `model` — `LlamaModel` loads GGUF weights and wires transformer layers
6|//! - `layer` — `TransformerLayer` with attention, FFN, RMSNorm
7|//! - `linear` — `Linear` layer for matrix multiplication
8|//! - `rms_norm` — RMS normalization
9|//! - `rope` — Rotary positional embeddings
10|//! - `sampling` — Token sampling (temperature, top-p, top-k)
11|//! - `tokenizer` — GGUF tokenizer integration
12|//!
13|//! ## Inference Flow
14|//!
15|//! ```text
16|//! GGUF file → LlamaModel::load_gguf() → forward(token, pos) → logits → sample() → next_token
17|//! ```
18|
19|pub mod layer;
20|pub mod linear;
21|pub mod model;
22|pub mod rms_norm;
23|pub mod rope;
24|pub mod sampling;
25|pub mod tokenizer;
26|
